## Interface: 16001
## Title: Zeppelin Signs
## Notes: Stand at a zeppelin tower or ship dock and a big sign at the top of your screen shows where it goes. Covers Horde zeppelins, Forever's skyships and the ships; move signs or add your own. Times every ride and shows a countdown on board. /zep
